Hello all! 
An update 1.2 is now live.
What's new?
- Added „Hard“ level in „Classic“ mode without trackers (You will get a prop that you have to carry with you through the wall);
- Addition of more than 40 new walls with various difficulty levels;
- Spectator camera in-game scene; 
- Due to received feedback walls speed was increased; 
- Adjusted calibration for even more accurate full-body tracking;
- From now on you will be able to jump when playing without trackers;
- Fixed small bugs. 

Have fun!
